          "table_row": "<tr xmlns:ns0=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">Abella<break />n = 132<break />United States<break />Parallel RCT<break /><ext-link ns0:href=\"https://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT04329923\" ext-link-type=\"uri\">NCT04329923</ext-link></td><td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">Median age: 33 yo (range 20–66)<break />Women: 69%<break />Chronic comorbidities: 29%<break />Hypertension: 21%<break />Asthma: 17%<break />Diabetes: 3%<break />Smoker: 0%<break />HCW: 100%<break />Household contact: 0%<break />High risk exposure (No mask or eye shield): 0%</td><td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">“Post-exposure prophylaxis”<break />Healthcare workers (physician, nurse, nursing assistant, emergency technicians, respiratory therapists) with practice in the emergency department and dedicated COVID-19 units that<break />1-Worked ≥20 hours per week in a hospital-based unit<break />2-Had no history of SARS CoV-2 infection<break />3-No symptoms suggestive of COVID-19 in the weeks before enrollment</td><td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">Hydroxychloroquine 600mg PO daily for two months</td><td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">Placebo</td><td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">Incidence of SARS CoV-2 infection as determined by a nasopharyngeal swab during 8 weeks of treatment</td><td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">8 weeks</td><td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">Philanthropic donations</td></tr>",
          "citation": "<ref xmlns:ns0=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" id=\"pone.0244778.ref016\"><label>16.</label><mixed-citation><named-content content-type=\"citation-string\">Abella BS, Jolkovsky EL, Biney BT, Uspal JE, Hyman MC, Frank I, et al. \nEfficacy and safety of hydroxychloroquine vs placebo for pre-exposure sars-cov-2 prophylaxis among health care workers: a randomized clinical trial. JAMA Intern Med. 2020; 10.1001/jamainternmed.2020.6319\n</named-content><ext-link ext-link-type=\"doi\" ns0:href=\"10.1001/jamainternmed.2020.6319\" /><ext-link ext-link-type=\"pmcid\" ns0:href=\"PMC7527945\" /><ext-link ext-link-type=\"pmid\" ns0:href=\"33001138\" /><ext-link ext-link-type=\"google-scholar\" ns0:href=\"journal=JAMA Intern Med&amp;title=Efficacy and safety of hydroxychloroquine vs placebo for pre-exposure sars-cov-2 prophylaxis among health care workers: a randomized clinical trial&amp;author=BS Abella&amp;author=EL Jolkovsky&amp;author=BT Biney&amp;author=JE Uspal&amp;author=MC Hyman&amp;publication_year=2020&amp;pmid=33001138&amp;doi=10.1001/jamainternmed.2020.6319&amp;\" /></mixed-citation></ref>"
